&lt;h2 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1wct3r9&quot; data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;276&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;277&quot; data-end=&quot;610&quot;&gt;As an Associate Manager in Solutions Engineering, you&#39;ll lead a team responsible for helping merchants successfully integrate Razorpay&#39;s payment solutions. Your role is to ensure smooth integrations, resolve technical issues quickly, improve team performance, and collaborate across Product, Engineering, Sales, and Customer Success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;18w7bso&quot; data-start=&quot;612&quot; data-end=&quot;635&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;t0d55u&quot; data-start=&quot;637&quot; data-end=&quot;656&quot;&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;657&quot; data-end=&quot;875&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4445xd&quot; data-start=&quot;657&quot; data-end=&quot;732&quot;&gt;Lead and mentor a team of around 15 integration engineers and team leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rte700&quot; data-start=&quot;733&quot; data-end=&quot;799&quot;&gt;Conduct regular 1:1s, set goals, and support career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1626eyo&quot; data-start=&quot;800&quot; data-end=&quot;875&quot;&gt;Drive a culture of ownership, accountability, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;ydobk8&quot; data-start=&quot;877&quot; data-end=&quot;903&quot;&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;904&quot; data-end=&quot;1212&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xxnyzm&quot; data-start=&quot;904&quot; data-end=&quot;1087&quot;&gt;Monitor and improve key metrics such as:
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;1087&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;blrg23&quot; data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;965&quot;&gt;SLA compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lafd6i&quot; data-start=&quot;968&quot; data-end=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;Mean Time to Integration (MTTI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;156dogc&quot; data-start=&quot;1004&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;Customer Satisfaction (CSAT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p3a09o&quot; data-start=&quot;1037&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;Customer Effort Score (CES)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;175c130&quot; data-start=&quot;1069&quot; data-end=&quot;1087&quot;&gt;Escalation rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6on2z2&quot; data-start=&quot;1088&quot; data-end=&quot;1149&quot;&gt;Manage critical merchant escalations and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dgfbzo&quot; data-start=&quot;1150&quot; data-end=&quot;1212&quot;&gt;Ensure high operational standards with minimal SLA breaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;ftetac&quot; data-start=&quot;1214&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;Integration Delivery&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wdbhax&quot; data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end merchant integrations from solution design to go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ohuw0&quot; data-start=&quot;1311&quot; data-end=&quot;1376&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot API, webhook, SDK, and payment integration issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1to5935&quot; data-start=&quot;1377&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;Create documentation, SOPs, and runbooks to improve efficiency and reduce recurring issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1cjsrud&quot; data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;Business &amp;amp; Cross-functional Collaboration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1518&quot; data-end=&quot;1780&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11mmoeq&quot; data-start=&quot;1518&quot; data-end=&quot;1594&quot;&gt;Work closely with Product, Engineering, Sales, and Customer Success teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;facekh&quot; data-start=&quot;1595&quot; data-end=&quot;1645&quot;&gt;Translate technical issues into business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fh1pf8&quot; data-start=&quot;1646&quot; data-end=&quot;1711&quot;&gt;Identify recurring problems and recommend product improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10jm6yr&quot; data-start=&quot;1712&quot; data-end=&quot;1780&quot;&gt;Drive adoption of automation and AI tools to improve productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;66wgf7&quot; data-start=&quot;1782&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1810&quot; data-end=&quot;2319&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dl5p4i&quot; data-start=&quot;1810&quot; data-end=&quot;1919&quot;&gt;5–6 years of experience in Solutions Engineering, Integration Engineering, or Technical Account Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ugljai&quot; data-start=&quot;1920&quot; data-end=&quot;1988&quot;&gt;Experience leading technical teams or serving as a technical lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14x7072&quot; data-start=&quot;1989&quot; data-end=&quot;2072&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of:
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2072&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3mxeoj&quot; data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2029&quot;&gt;REST APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j3x13k&quot; data-start=&quot;2032&quot; data-end=&quot;2038&quot;&gt;JSON&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1772krs&quot; data-start=&quot;2041&quot; data-end=&quot;2051&quot;&gt;Webhooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dzqs7t&quot; data-start=&quot;2054&quot; data-end=&quot;2072&quot;&gt;SDK integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ry1fut&quot; data-start=&quot;2073&quot; data-end=&quot;2115&quot;&gt;Payment or fintech experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nwjp3g&quot; data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2172&quot;&gt;Experience tracking and improving operational metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;24bgzj&quot; data-start=&quot;2173&quot; data-end=&quot;2230&quot;&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ahpi66&quot; data-start=&quot;2231&quot; data-end=&quot;2319&quot;&gt;Familiarity with tools such as Postman, Jira, Freshdesk, DevRev, or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;46wn7q&quot; data-start=&quot;2321&quot; data-end=&quot;2363&quot;&gt;What Success Looks Like (First 45 Days)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2365&quot; data-end=&quot;2668&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hpiki0&quot; data-start=&quot;2365&quot; data-end=&quot;2435&quot;&gt;Team performance metrics (MTTI, SLA) are stable and meeting targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qp4kt0&quot; data-start=&quot;2436&quot; data-end=&quot;2485&quot;&gt;Every team member has a clear development plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;837ap1&quot; data-start=&quot;2486&quot; data-end=&quot;2581&quot;&gt;At least one process improvement has been implemented to reduce manual effort or escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fzthts&quot; data-start=&quot;2582&quot; data-end=&quot;2668&quot;&gt;Strong working relationships established with Product, Sales, and Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;nbk8dt&quot; data-start=&quot;2670&quot; data-end=&quot;2695&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2697&quot; data-end=&quot;2940&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3bdpx8&quot; data-start=&quot;2697&quot; data-end=&quot;2739&quot;&gt;Strong technical troubleshooting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vvqiu3&quot; data-start=&quot;2740&quot; data-end=&quot;2793&quot;&gt;Excellent people management and coaching abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b0z5wu&quot; data-start=&quot;2794&quot; data-end=&quot;2824&quot;&gt;Data-driven decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;os5fn9&quot; data-start=&quot;2825&quot; data-end=&quot;2881&quot;&gt;Ownership mindset with a focus on solving root causes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18lmbnl&quot; data-start=&quot;2882&quot; data-end=&quot;2940&quot;&gt;Ability to balance technical depth with business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
